{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03366","headline":"游禹穴回出若邪 · 宋之问","name":"游禹穴回出若邪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹穴今朝到，邪溪此路通。\n着书闻太史，链药有仙翁。\n鹤往笼犹挂，龙飞劒已空。\n石帆摇海上，天镜落湖中。\n水低寒云白，山边坠叶红。\n归舟何虑晚，日暮使樵风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}